<title>INDIA: CRICKET - INDIA 302-7 AT LUNCH VS S.AFRICA 428.</title>
<headline>CRICKET - INDIA 302-7 AT LUNCH VS S.AFRICA 428.</headline>
<dateline>CALCUTTA 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>India had scored 302 runs for seven wickets at lunch on the third day of the second test on Friday in reply to South Africa's first innings total of 428.</p>
</text>
